      "ids": [
        {
          "system_name": "SUSE CVE Page",
          "text": "https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-38087"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet/sched: fix use-after-free in taprio_dev_notifier\n\nSince taprio's taprio_dev_notifier() isn't protected by an\nRCU read-side critical section, a race with advance_sched()\ncan lead to a use-after-free.\n\nAdding rcu_read_lock() inside taprio_dev_notifier() prevents this.",
          "title": "CVE description"
        }
      ],
